        "item_bHzngY": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How long will it take to receive my order?",
            "text_size": "h4",
            "content": "<p>We process all orders within <strong>[1-3]</strong> business days. Once your order has been dispatched from our warehouse, standard shipping typically takes <strong>[5-7]</strong> business days, depending on your location. Expedited shipping options are available at checkout. Please note that international shipping times may vary and can take up to <strong>[14-21]</strong> days.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_RGMrHr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "What is your return and exchange policy?",
            "text_size": "h4",
            "content": "<p>We want you to love your purchase! We offer a <strong>[30-day]</strong> return policy for most items. To be eligible for a return or exchange, your item must be unused, in the same condition that you received it, and in its original packaging. Simply contact our customer support team at <strong>[Email Address]</strong> with your order number to initiate the process. Please note that return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the item is defective.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_nceVP8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How can I track my order?",
            "text_size": "h4",
            "content": "<p>As soon as your order ships, we will send you a shipping confirmation email that includes a tracking number. You can click the link in the email to view the live status of your delivery on the carrier's website. You can also track your package at any time by logging into your store account or visiting our \"Track Order\" page.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_NQRQAp": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "What payment methods do you accept?",
            "text_size": "h4",
            "content": "<p>We accept all major credit and debit cards, including Visa, MasterCard, American Express, and Discover. For your convenience, we also offer secure express checkout options through PayPal, Apple Pay, and Google Pay. All transactions processed through our store are securely encrypted to ensure your personal and financial information is strictly protected.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
